WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.888
Hi, I'm Peter.

2
00:00:02.889 --> 00:00:04.930
I'm in the second grade.

3
00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:08.231
I have one thing to say:

4
00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:11.306
It's not easy being a kid!

5
00:00:11.307 --> 00:00:18.491
Being a kid might look like fun, but sometimes it's not.

6
00:00:18.492 --> 00:00:22.403
Yesterday, I was playing outside with my friend.

7
00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:27.572
I was having a really good time.

8
00:00:27.573 --> 00:00:33.563
Then suddenly my mother said, "Peter, it's time to come inside now.

9
00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:35.798
It's getting dark."

10
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:44.053
When you're an adult, no one can tell you what to do or when to do it.

11
00:00:44.054 --> 00:00:50.491
When you're a kid, you have to get up early in the morning and go to school.

12
00:00:50.492 --> 00:00:58.393
At school you have to study math, English, science, and history.

13
00:00:58.394 --> 00:01:02.089
After school, you have to do your homework.

14
00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:11.287
When you're an adult, you do not have to go to school and you never have homework.

15
00:01:11.288 --> 00:01:15.739
When you're a kid, there are many things you can't watch.

16
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:20.182
Last Saturday there was a scary movie on TV.

17
00:01:20.183 --> 00:01:24.388
It looked really exciting.

18
00:01:24.389 --> 00:01:27.636
But my father would not let me watch.

19
00:01:27.637 --> 00:01:31.533
He said, "You're too young for this movie, Peter."

20
00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:38.571
When you're an adult, you can watch anything you want. When

21
00:01:38.572 --> 00:01:43.446
you're a kid, the older kids sometimes pick on you. When

22
00:01:43.447 --> 00:01:51.795
I was walking home from school on Monday, Tom and Steve bothered me. Steve

23
00:01:51.796 --> 00:01:55.678
took my schoolbag and put it in a tree. It

24
00:01:55.679 --> 00:01:57.919
made me very mad. When

25
00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:04.261
you're an adult, no one can pick on you. When

26
00:02:04.262 --> 00:02:09.244
you're a kid, you can't go anywhere by yourself. Last

27
00:02:09.245 --> 00:02:14.554
Friday, I wanted to buy a birthday gift for my friend John. But

28
00:02:14.555 --> 00:02:21.114
I had to wait for my mom to return home. When

29
00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:28.064
I want to go somewhere, I have to ride my bike or ask my mom for a ride. When

30
00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:35.860
you're an adult, you can drive a car wherever you want. When

31
00:02:35.861 --> 00:02:40.108
you're a kid, you have to go to bed early. On

32
00:02:40.109 --> 00:02:47.034
school nights, my mom makes me go to bed at 9:00. But

33
00:02:47.035 --> 00:02:52.959
I do have a mom and dad who love me, which is really great. So

34
00:02:52.960 --> 00:03:02.445
I guess I like being a kid, even though— it’s not easy being a kid!

